WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.925
Start with the metering hopper and weigh belt.

00:00:02.995 --> 00:00:08.235
The equipment feeds whole potatoes while the
batch record preserves their supplier lot.

00:00:08.444 --> 00:00:11.322
Connect belt scale load to AI01.

00:00:11.392 --> 00:00:14.636
Connect AO01 to the feeder speed demand.

00:00:14.706 --> 00:00:18.258
The measurement comes in, and the speed request
goes out.

00:00:18.468 --> 00:00:22.242
Set the training feed rate to 100 kilograms per
minute.

00:00:22.312 --> 00:00:26.144
A 1,000 kilogram charge then takes ten model
minutes.

00:00:26.354 --> 00:00:28.777
Inject the belt scale quality fault.

00:00:28.847 --> 00:00:32.782
The last weight may still be visible, but the
feeder must hold.

00:00:32.992 --> 00:00:35.977
Restore the load-cell signal and verify zero.

00:00:36.047 --> 00:00:40.805
Prove the recovery before releasing the same
1,000 kilogram lot to washing.
